{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TOYA is a minimalist cube-rolling game that is always bigger than you think\u2026</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/cb7dfaa3a93cd1076e227ee95fc0ab9f.poster.avif?t=1762411308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/cb7dfaa3a93cd1076e227ee95fc0ab9f.webm?t=1762411308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/cb7dfaa3a93cd1076e227ee95fc0ab9f.mp4?t=1762411308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a squishy purple Toya on their journey through an abstract, blocky world filled with puzzles and wonder.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/488059180442bd1596f573bf9e159d7d.poster.avif?t=1762411308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/488059180442bd1596f573bf9e159d7d.webm?t=1762411308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/488059180442bd1596f573bf9e159d7d.mp4?t=1762411308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the Toya will 'Cube Up' into a larger Toya, unlocking new abilities and areas to explore.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/8e4215db1d2bacf134dd7b85ae3db4b7.poster.avif?t=1762411308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/8e4215db1d2bacf134dd7b85ae3db4b7.webm?t=1762411308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/8e4215db1d2bacf134dd7b85ae3db4b7.mp4?t=1762411308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout this strange world there are unique mechanics and interesting problems to solve with them.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/880ef74e91402f8fb7186f46648a497f.poster.avif?t=1762411308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/880ef74e91402f8fb7186f46648a497f.webm?t=1762411308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/extras/880ef74e91402f8fb7186f46648a497f.mp4?t=1762411308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow and grow you never quite know what's around the corner. Come find out...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841420?t=1762411308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/665a663b8b70e63cfac77f80654de238102668b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762411308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/01902eded14c2aabd2f20097d34fee900e960c5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762411308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841420/01902eded14c2aabd2f20097d34fee900e960c5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762411308","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":